png" alt=3D"" width=3D"400">=0A<figcaption>Safari with Grid Lanes on the Le=
ft, Firefox without on the right. Whatever.</figcaption>=0A</figure>=0A<hr =
/>=0A<p>Perhaps you=E2=80=99ve heard of customizeable <code>&lt;select&gt;<=
/code> menus now. They are absolutely awesome. You have full CSS control. A=
nd for the most part, all of you fine sensible people will do sensible and =
